w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ydKlqKvW4cQ7kNvwFTddqx&_nc_oc=AdoR53eGSkt_C2I3hACd96AbtN_7FUWtGmmqdYVb_AVgJuVJcpaoG-EHSvQmknRuOts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzjb6rvtK46ptGmefOz6AhLWt7kO4VABRevath2ybt3Jw&oe=69C12AAA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkpo5V8CXDAQ7kNvwEpttKW&_nc_oc=AdrJOjzv_-dokuTJYYdZZitFl8rNn_CE_4M729c5scpXzLvoyJNjGKz-ok3YEDqyMyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxl9_YW_UKoCApT7EInmUF9kdNs45fnyMy4uzwaPIiGHQ&oe=69C13D5E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=94O_pcVe6kMQ7kNvwHq4IJ8&_nc_oc=Adrwb99wEOgi6hSZeg6Nify8zdAzZbwXvloGmuaXEyaxvnzrPDQed3ZJIg48qz05iL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXby4upH-fnWe878B9TbeQAurUrugwmDb7DYcRARWuaw&oe=69C12C31"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9